    <!-- Story Section -->
    <section class="section" style="background: var(--dark-800);">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="story-grid">
                <div class="story-content">
                    <span class="label">Our Story</span>
                    <h2>Remote-First, Strategy-Driven</h2>
                    <p class="lead">DataSphere Digital Solutions is a remote-first creative tech company based in
                        Arusha, Tanzania.
                        We specialize in IT consultation that empowers individuals, startups, organizations, and
                        enterprises
                        to make smart, scalable digital decisions.</p>
                    <p>Every service we offer—from branding to dashboards—is rooted in strategic guidance, ensuring
                        clarity,
                        confidence, and impact. Our consultation process is the foundation of everything we do. We help
                        clients
                        define their digital strategy, choose the right tools, and build systems that grow with them.
                    </p>
                    <p>Whether you're launching a new business, scaling operations, or upgrading your tech stack—we
                        start with
                        understanding your goals and build from there. Today, we proudly serve clients globally while
                        remaining
                        deeply connected to our East African roots.</p>

                    <div class="story-stats">
                        <div class="story-stat">
                            <span class="number">50+</span>
                            <span class="label">Happy Clients</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="story-stat">
